{"unit_id":"iiiweiii__dsh-guardwall#card-zh","repo":"iiiweiii/dsh-guardwall","commit":"162ff316eacde260e810d55c67a5c7513e044937","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-guardwall（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 插件安装和工具调用提供体检与运行时护栏。它接入 tools/execute、tools/result 事件，并注册状态、体检、白名单和规则工具。主要功能包括安装前源码权限清单与评分、风险工具调用拦截、输出内容审计、HMAC 链式日志和自定义规则热加载。适合需要查看插件权限并为 DSH 工具调用配置规则的用户。使用前需要 Node.js 18 或更高版本；不需要额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:25-27","index.js:92-146","index.js:154-220","index.js:254-295","lib/audit.js:34-55"]}
{"unit_id":"iiiweiii__dsh-guardwall#card-en","repo":"iiiweiii/dsh-guardwall","commit":"162ff316eacde260e810d55c67a5c7513e044937","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-guardwall is a DSH web plugin for pre-install plugin vetting and runtime tool guardrails. It inventories permissions, scores plugins, blocks risky calls, audits outputs, keeps HMAC-chained local logs, and hot-loads custom rules. Requires Node.js 18+; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:25-27","index.js:92-146","index.js:154-220","index.js:254-295","lib/audit.js:34-55"]}
